    <briefdescription>
<para>This backend operates in the second round of a two-codegen round process. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>It starts by reading the optimized bitcode files that were saved during the first round. The backend then executes the codegen only to further optimize the code, utilizing the codegen data merged from the first round. Finally, it writes the resulting object files as usual. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
